OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged over alleged plot to
OL,4,Atarget Manchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian nationals who arrived in
OL,7,Fthe UK by small boat have been charged
OL,8,Fwith terror offences over an alleged
OL,9,Fplot to target the Jewish community in
OL,10,FManchester.
OL,12,FRahman Salehi, 34, of Salford, and
OL,13,FSalam Ahmadyan, 36, from Liverpool, are
OL,14,Faccused of preparing to commit an act
OL,15,Fof terrorism or assisting another to
OL,16,Fcommit an act of terrorism on or before
OL,17,F20 September.
OL,19,FThe men were arrested in Manchester's
OL,20,FNorthern Quarter on the eve of Yom
OL,21,FKippur, considered the holiest day in
OL,22,Fthe Jewish calendar.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
